    apply cards _ _ B (Mast Y φ) (Carrier.turf Y) (sideE Y) (rentalM Y φ) hp M hM h0 he hQ hS (pℓ) p' (kind Y) h1 h2 (Carrier.eclipse Y φ 1 1 hh hR hy hk (by simp) (by simp) ht) (Carrier.status Y φ 1 1 hh) ?_ (optic_mark i₀ Y φ p1 r1 f0 g k₀ k₁ hh hpM hk ht) -- inspect
